{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04140","headline":"幸白鹿观应制 · 徐彦伯","name":"幸白鹿观应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤舆乘八景，龟籙向三仙。\n日月移平地，云霞缀小天。\n金童擎紫药，玉女献青莲。\n花洞留宸赏，还旗绕夕烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}